			"notes": "## 变更内容 (Changes)\n\nSince `v1.2.34`:\n\n- `a10ec16` fix(ime): Release 键无条件补发——修 chromium 卡键/自动 repeat 疯狂删字\n\n---\n\n## 平台与产物 (Platforms & Assets)\n\n**Single universal jar** — install on every supported platform.\nThe mod auto-detects the host OS at startup:\n\n- **Linux x86_64 / arm64** — full capture + share + view (Portal ScreenCast / PipeWire / xwayland-satellite)\n- **Android x86_64 / arm64** — full capture + share + view (OnyxLauncher, etc.)\n- **Windows / macOS / iOS** — viewer-only (receives shared windows, no local capture; native platform auto-detect skips libwaylandcraft.so)\n- **Dedicated server** — pure Java server-side logic (give / permission / share)\n\n- waylandcraft-1.2.35.jar\n\n源码包 (Source code): zip / tar.gz 由 GitHub 自动附加。"
